# Every tracked file in this repository is text. Windows checkouts under WSL were producing CRLF
# working-tree copies of LF blobs, so `git status` reported 18 source files as wholly rewritten
# (3,248 insertions / 3,248 deletions) with no substantive change, and each commit risked sweeping
# that churn in. Normalising on checkout and on add keeps it out.
#
# A dozen review documents under docs/superpowers/ were themselves committed with CRLF blobs
# (pasted from Windows). They are deliberately NOT renormalised here: doing so would add ~3,400
# lines of pure line-ending diff to a branch that is already large, for prose that nothing reads
# programmatically. They will normalise on their own the next time one of them is edited.
* text=auto eol=lf
